   "id": 511729,
   "description": "*** Zoom Link in Email Confirmation and Day-Of-Event Instructions Emails ***\n\nFollow This Week's Priority Links:\nhttps://linktr.ee/BlueVictoryWarRoom \n\n# # # # # # # # # # # # # #\n\nJoin Blue Victory 2026 War Room as we celebrate the eve of Barack Obama's 65th Birthday and discuss lessons from his historic presidential campaigns based on a presentation Host Jim McBride delivered to New Leaders Council (newleaderscouncil.org) on May 16th and some developments after his trip to Netroots Nation in Philadelphia and the Obama Presidential Center Celebration in Chicago this June. This is especially relevant to answering some of the concerns about the future of the DNC and the Democratic Party as we head into the midterms and a wide open primary schedule in 2028.\n\nWe will also discuss the latest updates on supporting Democrats before Election Day in November.\n\nBlue Victory Event Host Jim McBride is a Swing Left Group Leader as well as Member of Virginia Grassroots Coalition and the Fairfax County Democratic Committee. He is focused on mobilizing grassroots networks from DC/MD/VA and beyond.\n\nJim previously served as a Harris-Walz & DNC & Biden-Harris Community Leader,  Communications Director of the DC/MD/VA Grassroots Coordinating Committee and served as the 1st Volunteer Database Coodinator for Virginia For Obama and founded Generation Obama-DC/MD/VA Chapter in 2007. \n\nFOLLOW US:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/bluevictorywarroom\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/bluevictorywarroom\nhttps://twitter.com/bluevictoryusa\n\nABOUT SWING LEFT:\n\nSwing Left is a national network that helps people find high impact ways to support Democratic candidates. We focus on the most flippable races as an important step towards ensuring the progressive change needed to create a more inclusive and equitable government and society.",
